  "official_faq": [
    {
      "question": "Can I use this \"Give up to 1 rested DON!! card to its owner's Leader or 1 of their Characters.\" effect to either give one of my rested DON!! cards to my own Leader or Characters, or to give one of my opponent's rested DON!! cards to their Leader or Characters?",
